k><name>OBA, HIROAKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TSUJI, TSUYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMAGUCHI, MIKIO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A chloroprene latex composition which has a chloroprene polymer gel content of 3 to 40 wt. % and in which the sol has a weight-average molecular weight of 400,000 or higher. The chloroprene latex is excellent in initial adhesion performance and ordinary adhesion performance and has a satisfactory balance between these adhesion performances and such adhesion properties as high-temperature adhesion strength and wet adhesion strength.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une composition de latex à base de chloroprène, dont la teneur en gel polymère de chloroprène est comprise entre 3 et 40 % en poids, et dont le colloïde possède une masse moléculaire moyenne en masse de l'ordre de 400000 ou davantage. Ce latex à base de chloroprène possède d'excellentes caractéristiques tant dans ses performances d'adhérence initiale que dans ses performances d'adhérence ordinaire, lesquelles s'équilibrent de manière satisfaisante entre elles, ainsi que des propriétés d'adhérence telles que la résistance à hautes températures et la résistance au mouillé.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>